0..65 Comment "// A workspace is the packages its `workspace.gandr` names, found"
66..145 Comment "// above them. It is not a package: it states what its members share as a model"
146..224 Comment "// of `Gandr.Workspace`, which each member\'s package source imports, and names"
225..304 Comment "// its members, each a directory below it rooting a package. `gandr check` here"
305..383 Comment "// checks this source and every member, and writes each member\'s `gandr.toml`."
